---

---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#07111f] py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr] lg:items-start">
      <div>
        <div class="reveal-on-scroll chip mb-6">
          <span class="mini-label">Founder note</span>
        </div>
        <p
          class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-sm text-lg font-semibold leading-relaxed text-slate-300 font-heading"
        >
          Why we are building VoluChat for commerce operators first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-on-scroll max-w-4xl">
        <div class="relative pl-8 border-l-2 border-teal-500/30">
          <blockquote
            class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.18] text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading"
          >
            &ldquo;Growing stores do not lose revenue only because the product
            is weak. They lose it because the team cannot act on every cart,
            stock signal, customer question, and follow-up at the right
            time.&rdquo;
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div
          class="mt-10 grid gap-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center"
        >
          <p
            class="max-w-2xl text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-slate-300"
          >
            We built VoluChat to give Indian Shopify brands an agent layer that
            does the repetitive operating work while founders keep control over
            discounts, customer messages, and brand judgment.
          </p>

          <!-- Monogram avatar block for founder -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0 lg:justify-end">
            <div
              class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-teal-300"
            >
              VG
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-200">Vaibhav Goyal</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">
                Founder, VoluChat
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
